#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:9223
msgid ""
"Hollycast is a multi-platform emulator for Sega Dreamcast, Naomi, Naomi 2, "
"and Atomiswave arcade systems."
msgstr ""
"Hollycast es un emulador multiplataforma de Sega Dreamcast, Naomi, Naomi 2 y"
" sistemas arcade Atomiswave."

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:9227
msgid ""
"Based on Flycast, providing accurate emulation with enhancements for modern "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Basado en Flycast, ofrece una emulación precisa con mejoras para sistemas "
"modernos."

